      <title>Designing a scalable content management system on NoSQL technologies</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>NoSQL</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk discusses what it takes to design a scalable and searcheable content management system.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Which design decisions do we take?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; What NoSQL technologies do we choose and why?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; How do we model a CMS schema on top of them?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; What are the challenges we face to provide CMS and search functionality in a scalable and highly available environment?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  </description>
